{"t": 1795078152.5971007, "tool": "analyze", "code": "X=np.c_[np.ones_like(P),P,P**2]\nc,_,_,_=np.linalg.lstsq(X,dP_dt,rcond=None)\nr=dP_dt-X@c\nbest=None\nfor w in np.linspace(0.05,3,600):\n    Z=np.c_[np.ones_like(t),np.sin(w*t),np.cos(w*t),t]\n    cc,_,_,_=np.linalg.lstsq(Z,r,rcond=None)\n    e=np.mean((Z@cc-r)**2)/np.var(r)\n    if best is None or e<best[0]: best=(e,w,cc)\nprint(best)\n# also in terms of P*t interactions\nZ=np.c_[X,t,t*P,np.sin(best[1]*t),np.cos(best[1]*t)]\ncc,_,_,_=np.linalg.lstsq(Z,dP_dt,rcond=None); print(np.round(cc,4), np.mean((Z@cc-dP_dt)**2)/np.var(dP_dt))", "out": "(np.float64(0.11655202736126294), np.float64(0.05), array([  -0.99473934, -115.22161405,   -1.99492779,    6.01759926]))\n[ 47.5584  -3.8914   0.13     0.9755   0.1196 -27.2061 -33.9125] 0.007465425599819463\n"}
